{"seq":1,"slug":"room-acoustics-fundamentals","title":"室内声学基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/room-acoustics-fundamentals","wordCount":1412,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"室内声学基础\">室内声学基础</h1><p>在空荡荡的毛坯房里说话，每个字都拖着长长的回响，糊成一片；铺上地毯、挂上窗帘后，同样一句话立刻清晰干脆。这一变化背后是室内声学最核心的规律：声音在封闭空间里如何累积、衰减、清晰或浑浊。本篇建立全章共用的声学语言——声压级、反射与扩散、混响时间、吸声系数，它是后续 <a href=\"sound-insulation-noise-control\">隔声与噪声控制</a> 与 <a href=\"architectural-acoustics-design\">建筑声学设计（厅堂）</a> 共同的物理前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-声波-声压级与分贝\">核心概念：声波、声压级与分贝</h2><p>声音是介质中传播的机械纵波，靠空气分子的疏密交替携带能量。描述声音强弱用<strong>声压</strong>，但人耳可感的声压范围跨越六个数量级，于是用对数标度的<strong>声压级 SPL（dB）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mfrac><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_p = 20\\log_{10}\\frac{p}{p_0}\\quad(\\mathrm{dB})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">dB</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_0 = 2\\times10^{-5}\\,\\mathrm{Pa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Pa</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是听阈基准声压。对数标度带来两个反直觉但重要的结论：声压级不能直接相加——两个 60 dB 声源叠加是 63 dB（能量翻倍加 3 dB），而非 120 dB；声压级每增加 10 dB，人耳主观响度约翻一倍。人耳对不同频率敏感度不同，工程上用 <strong>A 计权（dB(A)）</strong> 模拟这一特性，是噪声评价的通用单位。</p>\n<p>声音进入房间后会反射、扩散、被吸收，下图描述一个声源在房间里的命运：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[声源] --&gt; Dir[直达声&lt;br/&gt;第一时间到达]&#10;  S --&gt; Wall[撞击墙顶地]&#10;  Wall --&gt; Ref[反射声&lt;br/&gt;延迟到达 加强响度]&#10;  Wall --&gt; Diff[扩散声&lt;br/&gt;方向打散 声场均匀]&#10;  Wall --&gt; Abs[被吸收&lt;br/&gt;转化为热 能量损失]&#10;  Dir --&gt; Ear((听者))&#10;  Ref --&gt; Ear&#10;  Diff --&gt; Ear\">flowchart TD\n  S[声源] --&gt; Dir[直达声&lt;br/&gt;第一时间到达]\n  S --&gt; Wall[撞击墙顶地]\n  Wall --&gt; Ref[反射声&lt;br/&gt;延迟到达 加强响度]\n  Wall --&gt; Diff[扩散声&lt;br/&gt;方向打散 声场均匀]\n  Wall --&gt; Abs[被吸收&lt;br/&gt;转化为热 能量损失]\n  Dir --&gt; Ear((听者))\n  Ref --&gt; Ear\n  Diff --&gt; Ear</pre><p>直达声决定方位与清晰度，早期反射声（约 50 ms 内）加强响度且有益清晰，过晚的反射声则成为有害混响或回声。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混响时间-室内声学第一指标\">混响时间：室内声学第一指标</h2><p>声源停止后，声音不会立刻消失，而是靠残余反射逐渐衰减。<strong>混响时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>60</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{60}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 定义为声压级衰减 60 dB（声能降到百万分之一）所需的时间，是室内声学最核心的单一指标。它由经典的<strong>赛宾公式（Sabine）</strong> 给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>60</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.161</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>A</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.161</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{60} = \\frac{0.161\\,V}{A} = \\frac{0.161\\,V}{\\sum_i \\alpha_i S_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.161</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.346em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.161</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是房间体积（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{m^3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是总吸声量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{m^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），等于各表面面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 乘其吸声系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的总和。公式揭示两条设计杠杆：体积越大混响越长（大教堂动辄数秒），吸声越多混响越短。</p>\n<p>混响时间没有&quot;越短越好&quot;——它要匹配用途。语言类空间要短（清晰优先），音乐类空间要长（丰满优先）。GB 50118-2010 等标准对教室、医院等空间规定 500–1000 Hz 的混响时间上限以保证语言清晰度（来源：<a href=\"http://www.jianbiaoku.com/webarbs/book/40/2409061.shtml\">GB 50118-2010 建标库</a>）。各类空间的最优混响范围，将在 <a href=\"architectural-acoustics-design\">建筑声学设计（厅堂）</a> 中按厅堂类型精确给出。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>空间类型</th>\n<th>主要诉求</th>\n<th>混响时间倾向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>教室、会议室</td>\n<td>语言清晰</td>\n<td>短（约 0.6–0.8 s）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>录音棚</td>\n<td>极干声场</td>\n<td>极短（&lt;0.3 s）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多功能厅</td>\n<td>兼顾</td>\n<td>中（可变声学）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音乐厅</td>\n<td>丰满温暖</td>\n<td>长（约 1.8–2.2 s）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"吸声材料与吸声机理\">吸声材料与吸声机理</h2><p>调节混响的钥匙是吸声系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（0–1，1 为全吸收）。不同材料靠不同物理机理吸声，且吸声特性随频率变化，这是声学设计的精细之处：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多孔吸声材料</strong>（矿棉、玻璃棉、吸声泡沫、地毯、织物）：声波在孔隙中摩擦生热而衰减，<strong>高频吸收强、低频弱</strong>，是最常见的吸声手段。</li>\n<li><strong>共振吸声结构</strong>（穿孔板+空腔、薄板共振）：利用亥姆霍兹共振或板振动，在<strong>特定中低频</strong>有吸收峰，专门补多孔材料的低频短板。</li>\n<li><strong>空间吸声体与吸声尖劈</strong>：悬挂的吸声块或消声室尖劈，吸声面积大、宽频高效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>低频吸声困难（即&quot;低频陷阱&quot;问题）是声学设计的长期难点，往往需要厚重的共振结构或大体积空腔。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声场扩散与声学缺陷\">声场扩散与声学缺陷</h2><p>均匀的声场需要声音被打散到各个方向，这靠<strong>扩散</strong>实现。规则的平行硬表面会导致两类典型缺陷：<strong>回声</strong>（清晰可辨的延迟反射，常见于大平行墙之间）和<strong>颤动回声（flutter echo）</strong>——声音在两平行硬墙间来回反射形成&quot;嘟嘟&quot;声。</p>\n<p>防治手段是引入扩散体（QRD 扩散板、不规则造型、起伏顶棚）把镜面反射打散为漫反射，或对其中一面做吸声处理。扩散与吸声的区别很关键：吸声是&quot;消灭&quot;声能，扩散是&quot;打散&quot;声能、保留响度——这一区别在 <a href=\"architectural-acoustics-design\">建筑声学设计（厅堂）</a> 中追求&quot;丰满又清晰&quot;时至关重要。值得一提，墙体不仅在室内反射声音，还会向相邻房间透射声音，那部分&quot;挡声音&quot;的物理属于 <a href=\"sound-insulation-noise-control\">隔声与噪声控制</a>，本篇只关注同一房间内的声场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>声音是机械纵波，强弱用对数标度的声压级（dB）描述，叠加遵循能量相加（两个等声源加 3 dB），A 计权模拟人耳频率响应。</li>\n<li>声音进房后分直达声、早期反射声、混响声，早期反射有益清晰，过晚反射有害。</li>\n<li>混响时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>60</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{60}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是室内声学第一指标，由赛宾公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>60</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.161</mn><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{60}=0.161V/A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.161</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 决定，需匹配用途而非越短越好。</li>\n<li>吸声靠多孔材料（高频强）、共振结构（中低频）等机理实现，低频吸声是难点。</li>\n<li>声场均匀靠扩散，平行硬墙易生回声与颤动回声，扩散打散声能而吸声消灭声能；隔声与厅堂设计在此基础上展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"室内声学基础","id":"室内声学基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：声波、声压级与分贝","id":"核心概念-声波-声压级与分贝"},{"level":2,"text":"混响时间：室内声学第一指标","id":"混响时间-室内声学第一指标"},{"level":2,"text":"吸声材料与吸声机理","id":"吸声材料与吸声机理"},{"level":2,"text":"声场扩散与声学缺陷","id":"声场扩散与声学缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"眩光与视觉舒适","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/light-and-vision/glare-and-visual-comfort"},"next":{"title":"隔声与噪声控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/sound-insulation-noise-control"}}